  "title": "Air Chief Marshal Ashutosh Dixit Takes Charge as New Chief of Air Staff",
  "summary": "Air Chief Marshal Ashutosh Dixit, a 59-year-old fighter pilot with over 3,500 hours of flying experience, assumed charge as the new Chief of Air Staff, succeeding Air Chief Marshal A P Singh. He was appointed after Singh retired after a 43-year career, and the IAF honored him with a ceremonial guard of honor. Dixit, known for his strategic planning and leadership, has led the IAF for four decades.",
  "facts": [
